id=COS17CommsEnabler
name=COS17 Comms Enabler (Contacts, Phone, Messages)
version=v1.6
versionCode=7
author=enawba
description=ColorOS 17 (IN/global): enables stock ColorOS Contacts + Phone (InCallUI) + Messages, optionally disables Google Dialer + Messages, puts English public holidays for your region into the ColorOS Calendar (Action button: do it now). ColorOS (global) Calendar is a separate APK on the release page.
